  ('Wera Tools 7mm Joker Combination Wrench', '5020199001', 'As installation spaces become increasingly tight and narrow during the assembly of your project, you need a tool that can operate from many placement points–and that''s exactly what Wera Tools'' 7mm Joker Combination Wrench can do! The combination of the 7.5° pivoted mouth and the double hexagon geometry doubles the wrench''s placement options. A repeated 180° turn of the wrench around the longitudinal axis during screwdriving provides four placement possibilities, and bolts or screw heads can be…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-7mm-joker-combination-wrench/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1869/images/10066/5020199001__33259__62483__90099.1701993986.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 2.5mm Hex-Plus T-Handle', '5023332001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-2-5mm-hex-plus-t-handle/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1608/images/8427/5023332001__50826__62252.1701993462.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 3mm Hex-Plus T-Handle', '5023334001', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-3mm-hex-plus-t-handle/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1606/images/8423/5023334001__51143__75857.1701993461.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 2mm Ball-End Hex-Plus L-Key', '5027102001', 'While used sparingly in goBILDA, the 2mm hex key will come in-handy when tightening the set-screw found in the flexible clamping shaft couplers.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-2mm-ball-end-hex-plus-l-key/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1033/images/5018/5027102001__53578__53450.1701992401.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 2.5mm Ball-End Hex-Plus L-Key', '5027103001', 'A ball-end hex L-key will allow you to get into otherwise impossible areas to tighten up a screw. The ball shape on the long end of the key allows for a misalignment of up to 20 degrees. The short end of the key is square-cut to provide maximum surface area when you have a clear shot at the screw and want to use the leverage of the key. The 2.5mm drive size is found on M5 set screws, M4 low-head screws and M4 button head screws.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-2-5mm-ball-end-hex-plus-l-key/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/655/images/3898/5027103001__16679__51165.1701992040.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 3mm Ball-End Hex-Plus L-Key', '5027104001', 'A ball end hex L-key will allow you to get into otherwise impossible areas to tighten up a screw. The ball-shape on the long end of the key allows for a misalignment of up to 20 degrees. The short end of the key is square cut to provide maximum surface area when you have a clear shot at the screw and want to use the leverage of the key. The 3mm drive size is found on M4 socket head screws.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-3mm-ball-end-hex-plus-l-key/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/657/images/3907/5027104001__59446__80547.1701992043.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 4mm Ball End Hex-Plus L-Key', '5027105001', 'A ball end hex L-key will allow you to get into otherwise impossible areas to tighten up a screw. The ball-shape on the long end of the key allows for a misalignment of up to 20 degrees. The short end of the key is square cut to provide maximum surface area when you have a clear shot at the screw and want to use the leverage of the key.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-4mm-ball-end-hex-plus-l-key/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1035/images/5021/5027105001__55754__01140.1701992403.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('Wera Tools 3mm Hex-Plus Bit (89mm Length, 1/4" Hex Drive)', '5059630001', 'It''s time to live up to your inner toolman and bring power tools to your robot-building with this 3mm Hex-plus Bit! While the power tool is not included, this product gives you the best 3mm hex bit we''ve ever used. Wera''s patented Hex-Plus profile helps to keep the driver in the drive and prevent it from rounding it out, and it''s a perfect match for 3mm hex drives of the M4 socket head screws we offer.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/wera-tools-3mm-hex-plus-bit-89mm-length-1-4-hex-drive/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2399/images/15006/5059630001_Ang1__71772__80118.1750944430.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'HARDWARE / Tools', 'gobilda'),
  ('5100 Series Spur Gearbox (26:1 Ratio, 1-1)', '5100-0101-0026', 'This 26:1 ratio spur gearbox is the same as found on the 5201-0002-0026 Spur Gear Motor. The replacement gearbox comes with the entire gearbox, including the pinion gear, new mounting screws and the plate to fasten it to the top of the motor housing. This gearbox is an excellent option whether you''re replacing a damaged gearbox to salvage a good motor or if you''re swapping ratios to modify the torque/speed ratio to better fit your needs.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5100-series-spur-gearbox-26-1-ratio-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1117/images/5573/5100-0101-0026__80481__00973.1701992577.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5100 Series Spur Gearbox (53:1 Ratio, 1-1)', '5100-0101-0053', 'This 53:1 ratio spur gearbox is the same as found on the 5201-0002-0053 Spur Gear Motor. The replacement gearbox comes with the entire gearbox, including the pinion gear, new mounting screws and the plate to fasten it to the top of the motor housing. This gearbox is an excellent option whether you''re replacing a damaged gearbox to salvage a good motor or if you''re swapping ratios to modify the torque/speed ratio to better fit your needs.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5100-series-spur-gearbox-53-1-ratio-1-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1119/images/5583/5100-0101-0053__69252__18141.1701992580.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (3.7:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0003', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0003 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-3-7-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1632/images/8574/5103-0024-0003__44246__06939.1701993512.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (5.2:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0005', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-0024-0005 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-5-2-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1635/images/8577/5103-0024-0005__71858__25333.1701993513.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (13.7:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX™ Shaft)', '5103-0024-0014', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0014 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-13-7-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1637/images/8586/5103-0024-0014__38725__24066.1701993515.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (19.2:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0019', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0019 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-19-2-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1639/images/8593/5103-0024-0019__08573__53837.1701993517.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (26.9:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX™ Shaft)', '5103-0024-0027', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-0024-0027 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-26-9-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1641/images/8600/5103-0024-0027__58255__85420.1701993519.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (50.9:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0051', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0051 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-50-9-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1643/images/8609/5103-0024-0051__98379__61295.1701993523.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (71.2:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0071', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0071 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-71-2-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1645/images/8612/5103-0024-0071__26502__96944.1701993524.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (99.5:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0100', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0100 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-99-5-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1647/images/8620/5103-0024-0100__91747__36672.1701993526.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (139:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0139', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0139 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA® pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-139-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1649/images/8624/5103-0024-0139__29347__05405.1701993527.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('5103 Series Planetary Gearbox (188:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 8mm REX® Shaft)', '5103-0024-0188', 'This planetary gearbox is a direct replacement to the gearbox found on the 5203-2402-0188 Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor. This gearbox is packed with features, such as the goBILDA pattern in the face, clearance cuts for nearby components, and a beefy 8mm REX® output shaft to drive your favorite 8mm REX® components!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5103-series-planetary-gearbox-188-1-ratio-24mm-length-8mm-rex-shaft/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1651/images/8628/5103-0024-0188__27246__76106.1701993528.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Planetary Gearbox Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Planet Gear for 5102 Series Gearbox (Steel, 14 Tooth, 5mm Thickness) - 3 Pack', '5105-0103-1405', 'These steel planet gears are designed for the 5102 Series Planetary Gearboxes found on the following 5202 Series Yellow Jacket Gear Motors: 5202-0002-0014 5202-0002-0019 5202-0002-0051 5202-0002-0071 5202-0002-0100 5202-0002-0188', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/planet-gear-for-5102-series-gearbox-steel-14-tooth-5mm-thickness-3-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1532/images/7864/5105-0103-1405__08837__65929.1701993295.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5201 Series, 26:1 Ratio, 210 RPM Spur Gear Motor w/Encoder', '5201-0002-0026', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5201-series-26-1-ratio-210-rpm-spur-gear-motor-w-encoder/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/834/images/4606/5201-0002-0026-FTC-Legal__36148__28583.1701992246.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5201 Series, 53:1 Ratio, 105 RPM Spur Gear Motor w/Encoder', '5201-0002-0053', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5201-series-53-1-ratio-105-rpm-spur-gear-motor-w-encoder/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/836/images/4621/5201-0002-0053-FTC-Legal__41351__17713.1701992249.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5202 Series Yellow Jacket Motor (1:1 Ratio, 24mm Length 6mm D-Shaft, 6000 RPM, 3.3 - 5V Encoder)', '5202-0002-0001', 'This Yellow Jacket has the same look and feel as the rest of the herd but has vastly different insides. The shaft of the motor is directly connected to the output shaft. What would normally be considered the gearbox remains to provide excellent support for the 6mm D-shaft that will be used to fasten a hub, gear, sprocket or pulley onto. It also serves as a built-in motor mount. The 16mm pattern M4 holes will align with nearly any goBILDA component. If your project desires more adjustability…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5202-series-yellow-jacket-motor-1-1-ratio-24mm-length-6mm-d-shaft-6000-rpm-3-3-5v-encoder/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1441/images/14787/5202-0002-0001__76049.1759847814.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5202 Series Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor (3.7:1 Ratio, 1620 RPM, 3.3 - 5V Encoder)', '5202-0002-0003', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5202-series-yellow-jacket-planetary-gear-motor-3-7-1-ratio-1620-rpm-3-3-5v-encoder/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1473/images/7405/25592__20005__84344.1701993151.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('5202 Series Yellow Jacket Planetary Gear Motor (5.2:1 Ratio, 1150 RPM, 3.3 - 5V Encoder)', '5202-0002-0005', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/5202-series-yellow-jacket-planetary-gear-motor-5-2-1-ratio-1150-rpm-3-3-5v-encoder/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1060/images/5164/5202-0002-0005-FTC-Legal__61479__58997.1701992451.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
