  ('RoboClaw 2x15A Motor Controller', 'IMC412', 'The Roboclaw 2x15A motor controller by Ion Motion Control can supply two brushed DC Motors with 15 Amps continuous and up to 30 Amps peak. With its multi mode interface it can be controlled from USB, RC Radio, serial devices, analog and or microcontrollers such as an Arduino or Raspberry Pi. Dual quadrature encoders with up to 19.6 million pulses per second are supported. In addition, a wide range of sensor inputs including potentiometers and absolute encoders are supported. Roboclaw''s close…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/roboclaw-2x15a-motor-controller/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/901/images/15147/RoboClaw-2x15A-Motor-Controller__23168.1755896026.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('RoboClaw 2x30A Motor Controller', 'IMC413', 'The Roboclaw 2x30A motor controller by Ion Motion Control can supply two brushed DC motors with 30 Amps continuous and up to 60 Amps peak. With its multi mode interface it can be controlled from USB, RC radio, serial devices, analog and or microcontrollers such as an Arduino or Raspberry Pi. Dual quadrature encoders with up to 19.6 million pulses per second are supported. In addition, a wide range of sensor inputs including potentiometers and absolute encoders are supported. Roboclaw''s close…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/roboclaw-2x30a-motor-controller/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/892/images/15154/IMC413-Roboclaw-2x30A-Motor-Controller__27434.1755896074.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('RoboClaw 2x60A Motor Controller', 'IMC414', 'The Roboclaw 2x60A motor controller by Ion Motion Control can supply two brushed DC motors with 60 Amps continuous and up to 120 Amps peak. With its multi mode interface it can be controlled from USB, RC radio, serial devices, analog and or microcontrollers such as an Arduino or Raspberry Pi. Dual quadrature encoders with up to 19.6 million pulses per second are supported. In addition, a wide range of sensor inputs including potentiometers and absolute encoders are supported. Roboclaw''s close…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/roboclaw-2x60a-motor-controller/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/894/images/15156/IMC414-Roboclaw-2x60A-Motor-Controller-Ang2__79311.1755896118.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('RoboClaw ST 2x45A Motor Controller', 'IMC419', 'The Roboclaw 2x45A motor controller can supply two brushed DC motors with 45 Amps continuous and up to 60 Amps peak. With its multi mode interface it can be controlled from USB, RC radio, serial devices, analog and or microcontrollers such as an Arduino or Raspberry Pi. Dual quadrature encoders with up to 19.6 million pulses per second are supported. In addition, a wide range of sensor inputs including potentiometers and absolute encoders are supported. Roboclaw''s close loop functionality…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/roboclaw-st-2x45a-motor-controller/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/896/images/15162/Roboclaw-2x45A-Motor-Controller-Screw-Terminal-Version-Ang2__28090.1755896176.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Controllers', 'gobilda'),
  ('FTC Starter Bot Resource Guide (DECODE™)', 'project-3200-2526-0001', 'Decode your FIRST ® steps into the season with this FTC Starter Bot from goBILDA®! The FTC Starter Bot can be built in its entirety using components found in the FTC Starter Kit (plus a REV Hub). Once you have your FTC Starter Kit in hand, come back to this page to review the Starter Bot''s Overview Video, Assembly Instructions, and Example Code. With those resources, your team will be able to start with a box of parts and end with your robot that performs core game tasks! This robot is…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/ftc-starter-bot-resource-guide-decode/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2408/images/15909/Ang2__54727.1772655830.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Robot-in-3-Days Resource Guide (DECODE™)', 'project-3200-2526-0002', 'This is the one(14)-stop resource page for the 2025 goBILDA® Robot-in-3-Days livestream for the FIRST Tech Challenge competition DECODE™ presented by RTX! Here you''ll find the entire show (as livestreamed in its entirety on Twitch and YouTube), as well as an overview video and a suite of downloadable resources--including CAD and code--to help you get hands-on with the robot that FTC Team #26949 - The Royal Society of Robotics built. And if you''d like to get to know the team that built the ''bot,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/robot-in-3-days-resource-guide-decode/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2422/images/15234/Ri3D-Resource-Guide-Team-Header__48571.1758731215.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('FTC Starter Bot Resource Guide (INTO THE DEEP℠)', 'project-3200-4008-2425', 'Jump-start your season with the FTC Starter Bot from goBILDA®! The FTC Starter Bot is built using only components from the FTC Starter Kit (plus a REV Hub). Once you have your FTC Starter Kit in hand, come back to this page to review the Starter Bot''s Overview Video, Assembly Instructions, and Example Code. With these resources, your team can start with a box of parts and end with a robot that performs core game tasks. This robot is designed specifically to compete in the 2024-2025 FTC season,…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/ftc-starter-bot-resource-guide-into-the-deep/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2236/images/13548/Ang1__55376.1728659251.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Robot-in-3-Days Resource Guide (INTO THE DEEP℠)', 'project-ri3d-2425', 'This is the one(15)-stop resource page for the 2024 goBILDA® Robot-in-3-Days livestream for the INTO THE DEEP℠ FIRST Tech Challenge competition! Here you''ll find the entire show (as livestreamed in its entirety on Twitch and YouTube), as well as an overview video and a suite of downloadable resources--including CAD and code--to help you get hands-on with the robot that FTC Team 10355 - Project Peacock built. And if you''d like to get to know the team that built the ''bot, head on over to their site…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/robot-in-3-days-resource-guide-into-the-deep/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2283/images/13617/Ri3D-Resource-Guide-Team-Header__70328__70910.1729546555.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Blinkin LED Driver', 'REV-11-1105', 'Blinkin makes adding LEDs to your robot as simple as driving a motor. Chose the pattern you want and give it the corresponding PWM signal. The REV Blinkin LED Driver is a compact LED driver module that simplifies controlling both 12V RGB LED and 5V individually-addressable WS2812 LED strips. Blinkin combines internal LED drivers, a 5V power source, and a pre-programmed controller all in one(16) package. Each of the 100 preloaded patterns can be customized to create just the look you want. Adjust…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1105/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/286/images/2715/Blinkin_Lone_Tilt__90547.1650559168.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('Analog Pressure Sensor', 'REV-11-1107', 'The REV Robotics Analog Pressure Sensor is a 5V sensor that can measure pressures up to 200 PSI. It outputs an analog voltage that is proportional to the measured pressure and can plug directly into the roboRIO or the More Board V2.0. Applications Real-time pressure feedback View on smart dashboard View on robot with devices such as the MXP Extension Cable Measuring actuation pressure Pressure-based decisions Is there enough pressure left for a specific action? Estimating current air volume…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1107/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/113/images/2759/PressureSensorWeb__26915.1650568869.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Sensors & Indicators', 'rev'),
  ('Digit MXP Display', 'REV-11-1113', 'The REV Robotics Digit is multi-use MXP board for interface with the roboRIO. It has four 12 segment displays, which can be used to show any letters or numbers. It also features an analog potentiometer and two momentary buttons. Teams can use the digit to display their battery voltage, select autonomous modes, tune PID variables, or display real time messages. The Digit communicates with the roboRIO using the I2C interface. The inspiration for this product came from FRC Hall of Fame Team 1538…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1113/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/144/images/2671/REV-11-1113-DigitMXPDisplay-FINAL__07086.1650552873.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('MXP Extension Cable', 'REV-11-1118', 'Extend the reach of your MXP port by using this 18" cable to reposition your boards where you need them. Fully compatible with all REV Robotics MXP accessory boards (More Board, Proto Board, & RIOduino) Specifications Keyed male and female 34-pin connectors 28 AWG ribbon cable 34 conductor 18&Prime; length', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1118/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/145/images/669/REV-11-1118-1__52108.1472438046.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('36in PWM Cable - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1130-PK4', 'The 36in PWM Cable - 4 Pack (REV-11-1130-PK4) is an ideal servo extension, providing a 3ft reach for servos, sensors, and other PWM-controlled devices. Featuring a universal 3-pin design with a female connector on one(17) end and a male connector on the other, this configuration allows you to easily daisy-chain multiple cables for custom lengths or extend the integrated leads of standard servos. 12in PWM Y Cable - 2 Pack (REV-11-1131-PK2), is used for splitting the signal from the roboRIO so you…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/PWM-Cables/?sku=REV-11-1130-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/962/images/3832/REV-11-1130-31-1817_PWMCables_FAMILY_FINAL_v2__75672.1779120505.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('12in PWM Y Cable - 2 Pack', 'REV-11-1131-PK2', 'The 36in PWM Cable - 4 Pack (REV-11-1130-PK4) is an ideal servo extension, providing a 3ft reach for servos, sensors, and other PWM-controlled devices. Featuring a universal 3-pin design with a female connector on one(18) end and a male connector on the other, this configuration allows you to easily daisy-chain multiple cables for custom lengths or extend the integrated leads of standard servos. 12in PWM Y Cable - 2 Pack (REV-11-1131-PK2), is used for splitting the signal from the roboRIO so you…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/PWM-Cables/?sku=REV-11-1131-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/962/images/3832/REV-11-1130-31-1817_PWMCables_FAMILY_FINAL_v2__75672.1779120505.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('36in 2-Wire Jumper Cable', 'REV-11-1134', '2-pin header cable that can be used for connecting signals, sensors or any other spots on robots. Features 2 female 0.1in pitch connectors on each end. Specifications Length: 91cm (36in) 2 pin receptacle on 0.1in pitch Wire Colors: red, black 22 AWG', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1134/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/211/images/2363/REV-11-1134_2-Wire-Jumper-Cable-2-Alicia-FINAL__78885.1636497194.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Servo Power Module', 'REV-11-1144', 'The Servo Power Module is a 6V 90W power injector that enables the use of high-power RC servos in applications where a robot controller cannot directly provide adequate power. The Servo Power Unit passes through input signals unaltered while providing up to 90W of total output power across all six channels. The input and output channels accept standard 3-wire 0.1in pitch servo/PWM cables. Features Built in DC-DC converter PWM signal status LED Screw terminals Over-current shutdown ESD…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1144/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/209/images/2764/ServoPowerModuleAngled-800-Web__59220.1650570152.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('Blinkin LED Cable Adapter', 'REV-11-1196', 'This cable is for use with the Blinkin LED Driver. This cable converts the JST PH 7-pin connector on the Blinkin'' LED Driver module to a males 3-pin JST SM and male 4-pin JST SM connectors for connecting 5V WS2812 addressable LED and 12V RGB LED strips respectively. All of these connectors are keyed and locking for improved reliability in high vibration environments (like your robot!) Specifications Input End: Female JST PH, 7-pin Connector 12V LED Output: Male 4-pin JST SM Connector 5V WS2812…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1196/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/287/images/1132/Blinkin_LED_Cable_Adapter__99274.1603470105.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('12V RGB LED Strip - 5m', 'REV-11-1197', 'This 12V RGB LED Strip is compatible with the REV Blinkin LED Driver (REV-11-1105). Each LED on the strip is wired in parallel and actually contains three embedded LEDs; a red, green, and blue LED. Each color can be controlled separately to create any color that you desire. Because these LEDs are wired in parallel, the entire strip will be the same color. Specifications 12V Supply Voltage Common-anode LEDs 60 LEDs/m Three LEDs per segment 5m Strip Length JST SM 4-pin Connector IP65 -…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1197/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/288/images/1134/12V_RGB_LED_Strip__79961.1515814180.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('5V Addressable LED Strip - 1m', 'REV-11-1198', 'This 5V WS2812B Addressable RGB LED Strip is compatible with the REV Blinkin LED Driver (REV-11-1105). Each LED contains an integrated driver IC and three LEDs; a red, green, and blue LED. Each individual LED can be controlled to create colorful patterns. Specifications 5V Supply Voltage WS2812B LED 60 LEDs/m one(19) LED per segment 1m Strip Length JST SM 3-pin Connector IP65 - Rubberized coating Adhesive Backing 10mm Width Approximately 3 Amps per meter (all LEDs at full brightness) Documentation…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1198/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/289/images/1133/5V_Addressable_LED_Strip__95511.1515854427.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Sensors', 'rev'),
  ('POE Injector Cable', 'REV-11-1210', 'The REV POE Injector Cable was specifically designed to address a common problem for many FRC teams with their wireless radios: intermittent power glitches. The wireless radios used in the last several FRC seasons can be powered either through a traditional barrel jack or through a Power Over Ethernet (POE) port. Traditional barrel jacks can easily work themselves loose and often require hacks like hot glue to prevent intermittent power glitches. The REV POE Injector Cable eliminates the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1210/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/290/images/1048/REV-11-1210-1__99321.1513383118.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK MAX Data Port Cover - 10 Pack', 'REV-11-1228-PK10', 'These plastic inserts are designed to go into the SPARK MAX Data Port to protect it from debris.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1228/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/381/images/1261/Data_Port_Cover_Pile__26228.1548199101.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('PWM Cable Clip - 10 Pack', 'REV-11-1229-PK10', 'These plastic clips are designed to keep standard 0.1" 3-pin PWM connectors together. Simply clip them around an assembled pair of connectors.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1229/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/382/images/1260/PWM_Cable_Clip_Working_Better__43274.1548199062.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('USB-A to USB-C 2.0 Cable - 1/2m - 5 Pack', 'REV-11-1231-PK5', 'The USB-A to USB-C 2.0 Cable - 2m (REV-11-1232) is a longer version of the USB-A to USB-C cable included with the SPARK MAX Motor Controller and the Control Hub. Use this cable to connect your SPARK MAX or Control Hub to a standard computer from up to 2 meters away. The USB-A to USB-C 2.0 Cable - 1/2m - 5 Pack (REV-11-1231-PK5) is the version of the USB-A to USB-C cable that is included with the SPARK MAX Motor Controller and the Control Hub. Use this cable to connect your SPARK MAX or Control…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/USB-A-to-USB-C-Cables/?sku=REV-11-1231-PK5', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/969/images/3854/REV-11-1232_USB-C-Cables_FAMILY_FINAL_1__52275.1785187365.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
  ('USB-A to USB-C 2.0 Cable - 2m', 'REV-11-1232', 'The USB-A to USB-C 2.0 Cable - 2m (REV-11-1232) is a longer version of the USB-A to USB-C cable included with the SPARK MAX Motor Controller and the Control Hub. Use this cable to connect your SPARK MAX or Control Hub to a standard computer from up to 2 meters away. The USB-A to USB-C 2.0 Cable - 1/2m - 5 Pack (REV-11-1231-PK5) is the version of the USB-A to USB-C cable that is included with the SPARK MAX Motor Controller and the Control Hub. Use this cable to connect your SPARK MAX or Control…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/USB-A-to-USB-C-Cables/?sku=REV-11-1232', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/969/images/3854/REV-11-1232_USB-C-Cables_FAMILY_FINAL_1__52275.1785187365.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / FTC Team Discount Program', 'rev'),
  ('Through Bore Encoder V1', 'REV-11-1271', 'The Through Bore Encoder V1 allows teams to place sensors in the locations closest to the rotation that they wish to measure. This rotary sensor measures both relative and absolute position through its ABI quadrature output and its absolute position pulse output. Mounting an encoder has never been easier with a 1/2in Hex Through Bore paired with the molded mounting holes which allow users to quickly place this encoder on the object they want to measure. Using one(20) of the included inserts allows…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1271/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/404/images/1487/Through_Bore_Encoder_Both_Shots_Sml__30025.1574098624.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK PWM Cable - 2 Pack', 'REV-11-1274-PK2', 'These SPARK PWM Cables have a JST-PH 4-pin connector on one(21) end, and a 0.1in 3-pin female PWM connector on the other. They are designed to convert the SPARK MAX Motor Controller ''s PWM/CAN port to a standard 3-pin PWM port on a robot controller. The black wire should be connected to the PWM port ground and pin the white wire should be connected to the PWM port signal pin. Specifications Wire length: ~7.75in (197mm) Documentation ION Build System Guide SPARK MAX Getting Started Guide SPARK MAX…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1274/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/383/images/1281/SPARK_MAX_PWM_Cable_Detail__77742.1580147376.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 6-pin Extension Cable - 90cm - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1275-PK4', 'These JST PH 6-pin Extension Cables are intended to extend the reach of sensor cables without having to cut and splice wires. Specifications REV-11-1275-PK4: Length: 90cm (35.5in) REV-11-3327: Length: 30cm (11.81in)', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/jst-ph-6-pin-extension-cables/?sku=REV-11-1275-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/904/images/3577/JST-PH6-pinExtensionCables_FAMILY_FINAL__67929.1760538618.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 6-pin Breakout Board - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1276-PK4', 'This JST-PH 6-pin Breakout Board is designed to adapt external sensors to the SPARK MAX 6-pin Encoder Port standard. It features a JST PH 6-pin connector, labeled solder pads, and through-hole pads that are compatible with popular 63R style quadrature encoders. This breakout makes it easy to connect external encoders to the SPARK MAX when running in Brushed Mode.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1276/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/386/images/1266/JST_PH_6-Pin_Breakout_Board_Lone__73061.1548199856.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 6-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1277-PK4', 'The JST PH 6-pin Joiner Boards (REV-11-1277-PK4) are intended to be used with the JST PH 6-pin Extension Cables to extend the reach of your NEO Brushless Motor sensor cables. The JST VH 2-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack (REV-31-1429-PK4) are small connector boards that can be used to join two JST VH 2-pin Motor Cables to create a longer cable. The JST PH 4-pin Joiner Board - 4 Pack (REV-31-1388-PK4) are small connectors that can be used to join two JST PH 4-pin Sensor Cables to create a longer cable.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/JST-Joiner-Boards/?sku=REV-11-1277-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/971/images/3831/REV-11-1277_JSTJoinerBoards_FAMILY_FINAL__44024.1778868134.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Tech Challenge / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK MAX Data Port Breakout Board', 'REV-11-1278', 'The SPARK MAX Data Port Breakout Board makes it easy to connect external sensors to the SPARK MAX Data Port. For additional information on the SPARK MAX Data Port, please take a look at the SPARK MAX User''s Manual. Analog Input Issue - Affects Rev. A Only Due to a manufacturing issue the analog scaling is not working as intended. Any input above 4.3V will maximize the output of the amplifier. Therefore, the scaled analog range is 0V - 2.83V. There are two possible workarounds for this issue:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1278/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/387/images/3148/REV-11-1278-SPARKMAXDataPortBreakoutBoard-Hero-FINAL__90792.1695750718.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('NEO 2.0 Sensor Cable', 'REV-11-1287', 'The NEO 2.0 Sensor Cable connects the NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor''s sensor port to a standard JST PH 6-pin interface used on REV motor controllers. The 2x3-pin PHSD connector provides a secure, latching connection at the motor, while the 6-pin JST PH end maintains compatibility with existing controller inputs. This cable is fully replaceable, giving teams the ability to swap damaged cables without servicing or replacing the motor. Keeping spare cables on hand helps maintain reliability and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1287/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/934/images/3713/REV-11-1287_HERO_FINAL__59132.1765297434.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition', 'rev'),
  ('4-Pin JST to PWM Sensor Adapter Cable - 2 Pack', 'REV-11-1292-PK2', 'The REV 4-Pin JST to PWM Sensor Adapter Cable allows for seamless connection of REV Robotics Sensors like the Magnetic Limit Switch and Potentiometer to the FRC Control System. Please note that this cable will not work for I 2 C type sensors. REV Robotics does carry an I 2 C compatible cable, the 4-pin JST PH to 4-pin roboRIO I2C Cable.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1292/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/291/images/1873/REV-11-1292-JST-PH-4-Pin-to-PWM-Connector-FINAL__60707.1614375085.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('4-pin JST PH to 4-pin roboRIO I2C Cable', 'REV-11-1729', 'This 4-pin JST PH to 4-pin roboRIO I2C Cable is designed to connect REV I2C sensors, like the REV Color Sensor V3, to the I2C port on the NI roboRIO for use in the FIRST Robotics Competition. Each cable is approximately 36 inches long. This cable was provided in the FRC 2020 Kickoff Kit but it is not included in the base Color Sensor V3 kit from REV Robotics.', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1729/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/517/images/1555/JST_PH_4-Pin_to_RoboRio_I2C_Cable_CORRECTED__43065.1578697368.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 6-pin to 4 Channel PWM Encoder Adapter Cable - 1m', 'REV-11-1817', 'The JST PH 6-pin to 4 Channel PWM Cable allows for seamless connection of the Through Bore Encoder into the FRC control system (roboRIO).', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1817/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/514/images/1556/JST_PH_6-Pin_to_4_Channel_PWM_Cable_CORRECTED__40088.1578697638.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Power Distribution Hub', 'REV-11-1850', 'With 20 high-current (40A max) channels, 3 low-current (15A max), and 1 switchable low-current channel, the REV Power Distribution Hub (PDH) gives teams more flexibility for overall power delivery. The Power Distribution Hub features toolless latching WAGO terminals, an LED voltage display, and the ability to connect over CAN or USB-C to the REV Hardware Client for real-time telemetry, making it easier than ever to wire and debug your robot. Features 20 High-current channels All supporting up…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1850/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/602/images/3245/REV-11-1850-Power-Distribution-Hub-Hero-FINAL__29576.1704386743.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Left & Right Walls', 'rev'),
  ('Power Distribution Hub Repair Service', 'REV-11-1850-RFB', 'This product is a Power Distribution Hub Repair Service, NOT a way to purchase a Power Distribution Hub. We strongly recommend reviewing the Hub Repair Service section of our Warranty and Returns page and contacting support@revrobotics.com before purchasing this item. Instructions Step 1: Contact Support Email support@revrobotics.com with details about the issue. Many issues can be resolved remotely without sending the Hub back. Step 2: Purchase A Repair Service (if needed) If the issue cannot…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1850-rfb/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/779/images/3248/REV-11-1850-RFB-Power_Distribution_Hub_Repair_Service-V1.1__59654.1704388647.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Pneumatic Hub', 'REV-11-1852', 'The REV Pneumatic Hub is a standalone module that is capable of switching both 12V and 24V pneumatic solenoid valves. The Pneumatic Hub features 16 solenoid channels which allow for up to 16 single-acting solenoids, 8 double-acting solenoids, or a combination of the two types. The user selectable output voltage is fully regulated, allowing even 12V solenoids to stay active when the robot battery drops as low as 4.75V. Digital and analog pressure sensor ports are built into the device,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1852/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/600/images/2510/REV-11-1852-PH-Hero-FINAL__53879.1641407488.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Pneumatic Hub Repair Service', 'REV-11-1852-RFB', 'This product is a Pneumatic Hub Repair Service, NOT a way to purchase a Pneumatic Hub. We strongly recommend reviewing the Hub Repair Service section of our Warranty and Returns page and contacting support@revrobotics.com before purchasing this item. Instructions Step 1: Contact Support Email support@revrobotics.com with details about the issue. Many issues can be resolved remotely without sending the Hub back. Step 2: Purchase A Repair Service (if needed) If the issue cannot be resolved…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1852-rfb/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/780/images/3137/REV-11-1852-RFB-Pneumatic_Hub_Repair_Service__91961.1686243303.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION', 'rev'),
  ('Servo Hub', 'REV-11-1855', 'The REV Servo Hub is compatible with both the REV ION and REV DUO systems. Over a single communication interface it can provide advanced control of up to six (6) servos. This means that the Servo Hub needs no additional PWM cabling between it and your robot controller, greatly simplifying wiring. The Servo Hub is easy to update and configure over the USB-C connection utilizing the REV Hardware Client. With a total current output of 15A shared across all channels, the Servo Hub will give you…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1855/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/834/images/3472/REV-11-1855-Servo_Hub-FINAL__22851.1736875921.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('Radio Power Module', 'REV-11-1856', 'The REV Radio Power Module is designed to keep one(22) of the most critical system components, the OpenMesh OM5P-AC WiFi radio, powered in the toughest moments of the competition. Traditional barrel jacks easily work themselves loose and often require hacks like hot glue to prevent intermittent power losses. The Radio Power Module eliminates the need for powering the radio through a traditional barrel power jack. Utilizing 18V Passive POE with two socketed RJ45 connectors, the Radio Power Module…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1856/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/601/images/3249/REV-11-1856-RadioPowerModule-Hero-FINAL__11706.1704391002.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('10A ATO Auto-resetting Breaker - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1860-PK4', 'REV Robotics custom ATO sized auto-resetting breakers are designed to give reliable protection for FRC robot actuators. These custom developed breakers adhere to SAE Standard J553 and will give consistent performance even after hundreds of breaker trips. A color-coded anodized aluminum case and stamped ratings allows for easy identification and inspection. Notice: Our latest batches of 40A and 10A breakers have minor cosmetic differences (anodization, label printing, and slightly longer tabs).…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/auto-resetting-breakers/?sku=REV-11-1860-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/901/images/3565/ATO-Auto-resetting-Breaker-10-40A_FAMILY__80436.1758909235.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('20A ATO Auto-resetting Breaker - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1861-PK4', 'REV Robotics custom ATO sized auto-resetting breakers are designed to give reliable protection for FRC robot actuators. These custom developed breakers adhere to SAE Standard J553 and will give consistent performance even after hundreds of breaker trips. A color-coded anodized aluminum case and stamped ratings allows for easy identification and inspection. Notice: Our latest batches of 40A and 10A breakers have minor cosmetic differences (anodization, label printing, and slightly longer tabs).…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/auto-resetting-breakers/?sku=REV-11-1861-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/901/images/3565/ATO-Auto-resetting-Breaker-10-40A_FAMILY__80436.1758909235.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('30A ATO Auto-resetting Breaker - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1862-PK4', 'REV Robotics custom ATO sized auto-resetting breakers are designed to give reliable protection for FRC robot actuators. These custom developed breakers adhere to SAE Standard J553 and will give consistent performance even after hundreds of breaker trips. A color-coded anodized aluminum case and stamped ratings allows for easy identification and inspection. Notice: Our latest batches of 40A and 10A breakers have minor cosmetic differences (anodization, label printing, and slightly longer tabs).…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/auto-resetting-breakers/?sku=REV-11-1862-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/901/images/3565/ATO-Auto-resetting-Breaker-10-40A_FAMILY__80436.1758909235.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('40A ATO Auto-resetting Breaker - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-1863-PK4', 'REV Robotics custom ATO sized auto-resetting breakers are designed to give reliable protection for FRC robot actuators. These custom developed breakers adhere to SAE Standard J553 and will give consistent performance even after hundreds of breaker trips. A color-coded anodized aluminum case and stamped ratings allows for easy identification and inspection. Notice: Our latest batches of 40A and 10A breakers have minor cosmetic differences (anodization, label printing, and slightly longer tabs).…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/auto-resetting-breakers/?sku=REV-11-1863-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/901/images/3565/ATO-Auto-resetting-Breaker-10-40A_FAMILY__80436.1758909235.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK CAN Cable V2 - 2 Pack', 'REV-11-1880-PK2', 'This update to the SPARK CAN Cable bridges the H and L CAN signals together within the cable itself. This prevents the CAN Bus breaking in the event of a cable disconnecting from a SPARK MAX Motor Controller. These SPARK CAN cables have a JST-PH 4-pin connector on one(23) end, and one(24) male and one(25) female 0.1in 3-pin PWM. They are designed to daisy chain with other SPARK cables to complete a CAN network in an FRC robot system. The CAN High is on the yellow wire and CAN Low is on the green wire.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1880/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/599/images/2078/REV-11-1880-SPARK-MAX-CAN-Cable-V2-FINAL__94523.1620762555.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('Alternate Encoder Adapter - 2 Pack', 'REV-11-1881-PK2', 'Absolute Encoder Adapter (REV-11-3326) connects the REV Through Bore Encoder directly to the SPARK MAX Data Port. This adapter connects the Absolute Duty Cycle output of the Through Bore Encoder to the correct SPARK MAX Data Port pins while leaving the incremental quadrature pins disconnected. Alternate Encoder Adapter (REV-11-1881-PK2) connects the REV Through Bore Encoder directly to the SPARK MAX Data Port when the SPARK MAX is configured in Alternate Encoder Mode. This adapter is not…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Encoder-Adapters/?sku=REV-11-1881-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/963/images/3799/REV-11-1881_EncoderAdapters_FAMILY_FINAL__12131.1778274004.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Mini Power Module', 'REV-11-1956', 'The REV Mini Power Module (MPM) is a compact power distribution module that allows you to securely and quickly power peripheral devices to your robot. Need more low-current channels on your PDH? Wire the MPM to one(26) of the high-current channels on the PDH to power more peripheral devices and custom circuits. Note: This device is only for power distribution and does not provide regulated power. New features were added to the Mini Power Module for the 2024 FRC season, including: "Output channels…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-1956/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/650/images/3253/REV-11-1956-MiniPowerModule-Hero-FINAL__91572.1704391159.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Control System', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK MAX Motor Controller', 'REV-11-2158', 'Building on the robust foundation of the original SPARK, the SPARK MAX Motor Controller incorporates advanced brushed and brushless DC motor control in a small and easy-to-use package with PWM, CAN, and USB connectivity. Never before has an FRC motor controller featured a built-in USB interface for configuration and control. Users can test prototypes and tune parameters without needing the full control system. SPARK MAX is a true all-in-one(27) controller that will push the envelope for teams.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-2158/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/360/images/2795/MAX_HERO-noflag__60247.1692730069.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK Flex Motor Controller', 'REV-11-2159', 'The SPARK Flex is a new smart motor controller that is compatible with the REV ION System. Its dockable form factor allows for the direct mounting onto a NEO Vortex, simplifying wiring while maintaining flexibility. Improving upon the foundation of the SPARK MAX Motor Controller, new features include 3-phase current sensing, reverse polarity protection, and an expanded Data Port with additional interfaces. When docked to an adapter, the SPARK Flex can control any existing NEO or compatible…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-2159/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/785/images/3228/REV-11-2159-SPARKFlexMotorController-Hero-FINAL__85152.1704233534.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('NEO Vortex Solo Adapter', 'REV-11-2828', 'The NEO Vortex Solo Adapter, allows teams to seamlessly integrate the NEO Vortex Brushless Motor with a SPARK MAX Motor Controller. This adapter breaks out the motor sensor connector and phase wire connections. While the NEO Vortex Solo Adapter allows you to use the motor independently, it may not fully support certain advanced functionalities of the NEO Vortex Brushless Motor. Specifications Motor Phase Wires Length: 150mm (5.91in) 12AWG Weight (w/ wires): 95g (0.21lbs) Included JST PH 6-Pin…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-2828/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/786/images/3276/REV-11-2128-NEOVortexSoloAdapter-Hero-FINAL__39181.1706728162.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Brushless / NEO Vortex & SPARK Flex', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK Flex Data Port Pigtail Cable - 4 Pack', 'REV-11-2852-PK4', 'The SPARK Flex Data Port Pigtail Cable breaks out the SPARK Flex Data Port to individual unterminated wires and is useful for connecting custom circuits or sensors without a standard connector. It features the keyed and locking Data Port connector to ensure a secure and aligned fit when plugged into the SPARK Flex Motor Controller. Each wire is uniquely color coded for easy identification: Specifications Length: 300mm (11.8in) Documentation ION Build System Guide ION Brushless System Guide', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-2852-pk4/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/824/images/3288/REV-11-2852-SPARKFlexDataPortPigtailCable-Top-FINAL__09259.1707775537.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Brushless / NEO Vortex & SPARK Flex', 'rev'),
  ('SPARK Flex Data Port Breakout Cable', 'REV-11-2853', 'The SPARK Flex Data Port Breakout Cable breaks out the default pin functions of the SPARK Flex Data Port into commonly used connectors for external sensors. The keyed and locking Data Port connector ensures a secure and aligned fit when plugged into the SPARK Flex Motor Controller. Its JST-PH 6-pin connector is designed to plug directly into the REV Through Bore Encoder, connecting both the quadrature and absolute encoder outputs to the appropriate SPARK Flex Data Port pins. Additional inputs,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-2853/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/825/images/3289/REV-11-2853-SPARKFlexDataPortBreakoutCable-Top-FINAL__81022.1707851563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Brushless / NEO Vortex & SPARK Flex', 'rev'),
  ('Flex Dock', 'REV-11-2858', 'The Flex Dock transforms the SPARK Flex (REV-11-2159) into a standalone motor controller, supporting REV brushless motors and virtually any 12V brushed DC motor by providing standard phase wire outputs. The 6-pin JST PH encoder port is compatible with NEO/NEO550 hall sensors in brushless mode and standard quadrature encoders in brushed mode. The dock securely mounts to a SPARK Flex using the same docking hardware as if you were mounting to a NEO Vortex. It features five #10-32 threaded…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-2858/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/787/images/3392/REV-11-2858-SPARKFlexDock-Hero-FINAL__85197.1733338054.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / FRC Voucher', 'rev'),
  ('Through Bore Encoder V2', 'REV-11-3174', 'The Through Bore Encoder V2 provides precise, reliable shaft position measurement with both incremental (ABI quadrature) and absolute (pulse-width) outputs. Its ½in hex through bore mounts easily within common FRC/FTC mechanisms, and the included inserts allow quick adaptation to ⅜in hex, 5mm hex, or ¼in round shafts. The Through Bore Encoder V2 delivers higher measurement accuracy—up to ±0.5°—while maintaining strong performance in environments where dust or debris may…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-3174/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/910/images/3574/REV-11-3174-ThroughBoreEncoderV2_HERO_FINAL__64112.1763159842.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('CAN Terminator Pack', 'REV-11-3324', 'The CAN Terminator Pack provides two compact, plug-ready termination options for teams looking to maintain reliable CAN bus performance anywhere in their robot''s wiring. Each terminator uses a small 10mm x 10mm internal circuit board sealed with heatshrink and contains a dedicated 120-ohm terminating resistor, ensuring proper end-of-line signal integrity on any CAN network. Designed for flexibility, the pack includes both a receptacle-side terminator and a pin-side terminator, making it easy…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-3324/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/941/images/3673/REV-11-3324_TOP_FINAL__90391.1764969953.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Absolute Encoder Adapter', 'REV-11-3326', 'Absolute Encoder Adapter (REV-11-3326) connects the REV Through Bore Encoder directly to the SPARK MAX Data Port. This adapter connects the Absolute Duty Cycle output of the Through Bore Encoder to the correct SPARK MAX Data Port pins while leaving the incremental quadrature pins disconnected. Alternate Encoder Adapter (REV-11-1881-PK2) connects the REV Through Bore Encoder directly to the SPARK MAX Data Port when the SPARK MAX is configured in Alternate Encoder Mode. This adapter is not…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Encoder-Adapters/?sku=REV-11-3326', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/963/images/3799/REV-11-1881_EncoderAdapters_FAMILY_FINAL__12131.1778274004.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('JST PH 6-pin Extension Cable - 30cm', 'REV-11-3327', 'These JST PH 6-pin Extension Cables are intended to extend the reach of sensor cables without having to cut and splice wires. Specifications REV-11-1275-PK4: Length: 90cm (35.5in) REV-11-3327: Length: 30cm (11.81in)', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/jst-ph-6-pin-extension-cables/?sku=REV-11-3327', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/904/images/3577/JST-PH6-pinExtensionCables_FAMILY_FINAL__67929.1760538618.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Molex Microfit+ Power and CAN Cable - 6in', 'REV-11-8020', 'The Molex MicroFit+ Power and CAN Cable is the dedicated replacement and accessory cable for the MAXSpline Through Bore Encoder. It provides both power and CAN connectivity through a compact, secure 2x2 Molex MicroFit+ latching connector. While currently used with the MAXSpline Through Bore Encoder, this cable is designed with forward compatibility in mind and will support additional SystemCore devices as they are released. The cable brings out CAN High and CAN Low on paired 22 AWG leads…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-8020/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/949/images/3722/REV-11-8020_MAXSplineEncoderCable_Hero-FINAL__85720.1765398932.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Encoder', 'REV-11-9008', 'The MAXSpline Encoder delivers high accuracy and robust performance while integrating seamlessly with the MAXSpline ecosystem. Using the same proven magnetic sensing architecture as the Through Bore Encoder V2, this model adds expanded connectivity through both ABI quadrature and CAN communication, giving teams more flexibility in how they collect and route sensor data. Its on-axis MA600 magnetic configuration ensures reliable readings even in environments where optical encoders struggle, and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-11-9008/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/931/images/3687/REV-11-9008_MAXSplineThroughboreEncoder-Hero-FINAL__19116.1764989476.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Electronics / Sensors & Indicators', 'rev'),
  ('MK Battery ES17-12 - 2 Pack', 'REV-19-2487-PK2', 'The MK Battery ES17-12 is commonly used in FIRST Robotics Competition robots. Specifications Manufacturer: MK Battery Voltage: 12V Capacity: 18AH (20 Hour Rate) Product Dimensions: 7.13in x 2.99in x 6.57in Weight: 12.89lbs Documentation MK Battery ES17-12 Spec Sheet', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-19-2487/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/733/images/2951/battery__38904.1660922625.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('WAGO 221 Inline Splicing Connector - 12 AWG - 50 Pack', 'REV-19-2491-PK50', 'The WAGO 221 Inline Splicing Connector is a robust and easy to use splicing connector that makes fiddling with hard-to-master crimp-style connectors a thing of the past. Simply lift the lever up, insert the stripped wire, and push the lever back down to make the connection. Compatible with up to 12 AWG solid, stranded, and fine-stranded conductors, the lever actuated WAGO CAGE CLAMP® excels both in electrical conductivity and mechanical holding force when compared to other common connectors…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-15-2491/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/654/images/2568/REV-19-2490-WAGO-Hero-FINAL__79462.1645201543.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Elevator Bearing Block - 2 Pack', 'REV-20-2051-PK2', 'The Elevator Bearing Block (REV-20-2051) is a trusted choice for smooth sliding motion between two pieces of rectangular tubing. It mounts on the narrow, 1in side, of tubing (e.g. 1x1 or 2x1) and uses shielded ball bearings for reduced friction. Its self-locating aluminum blocks simplify assembly, making it ideal for traditional elevator systems. Features Elevator Bearing Block Shielded ball bearings provide support in the lateral and thrust axes Aluminum blocks are notched to self-locate on…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-20-2051-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/921/images/3617/1200_source_1734473179__18289.1761848002.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition', 'rev'),
  ('1in Extrusion - 4ft', 'REV-21-1000', '1in Extrusion is compatible with the REV ION System. It''s a 1in x 1in square extruded aluminum tube, with slots designed to fit standard #10 hardware rather than expensive t-nuts. Take your robot mechanisms to a new level of sleekness with the Black Anodized version of this extrusion! *Please note: Due to manufacturing and shipping constraints there may be small scratches that expose the raw aluminum underneath the anodized layer. Cosmetic scratches that do not affect the function or integrity…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-extrusion/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/389/images/2916/REV-21-0000-1in-Extrusion-Hero-FINAL__03397.1659382438.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('Eccentric Bushing', 'REV-21-1029', 'Eccentric bushings are used to hold our V-Groove Bearings (REV-29-1014) for linear motion applications. The hole is drilled off-center of the bearing axis so by rotating the bushing on its mounting bolt, the clearance between the wheel and track can be adjusted. This allows users to decide how tight or loose they would like to tune their linear motion system. Specifications Material: 6061-T6 aluminum Overall length: 0.812in Hex width: 0.5in Bearing post diameter: 0.375in Bore diameter: 0.257in…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1029/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/124/images/645/REV-21-1029-1__75506.1472438035.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('Concentric Bushing', 'REV-21-1030', 'Concentric bushings are used to hold our V-Groove Bearings (REV-29-1014) for linear motion applications. Used in conjunction with our Eccentric Bushing (REV-21-1029), the user can adjust how tight or loose they would like to tune their linear motion system. Specifications Material: 6061-T6 aluminum Overall length: 0.812in Hex width: 0.5in Bearing post diameter: 0.375in Bore diameter: 0.257in Documentation ION Build System Guide 1inLinearMotionGuide CAD & Drawings SKU-STP REV-21-1030 Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1030/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/121/images/640/REV-21-1030-1__69099.1497541532.500.500.JPG?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('Dual Bearing Plate', 'REV-21-1032', 'This dual bearing plate holds two V-Groove Bearings (REV-29-1014) to create an easy linear motion system for the ION Build System 1in Extrusion (REV-21-1000). Using a combination of Concentric (REV-21-1030) and Eccentric (REV-21-1029) bushings, the user can adjust how tight or loose they would like to tune their linear motion system. This plate can also be used in conjunction with regular 3/8in bearings for building linear motion systems utilizing standard 1in x 2in tubing. Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1032/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/123/images/1130/Dual_Bearing_Plate_Side__92012.1515803935.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion', 'rev'),
  ('1/2in Rounded Hex Shaft - 36.0in (not tapped)', 'REV-21-1135', '1/2in Rounded Hex Shafts are compatible with the REV ION System and are a ready-to-use length of hex shaft that have been cut to length and have the ends tapped. The ends are tapped #10-32 in order to accept a screw and washer or shaft collar. The 1/2in hex is compatible with the shaft retention method of the MAXPlanetary output stage. The 1/2in Rounded Hex Shaft - 36in is not tapped. Note for (REV-21-1135) 1/2in Rounded Hex Shaft - 36.0in (not tapped): Our 1/2" Rounded Hex Shafts are…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/.5in-Rounded-Hex-Shafts/?sku=REV-21-1135', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/675/images/2948/REV-21-0000-2809-2823-0.5inRoundedHexShaft-FamilyHero-FINAL__95578.1660668305.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Extrusion Endcap Slide - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-1202-PK4', 'The 1in Extrusion Endcap Slide allows teams to create compact and robust multistage lifts when combined with the 1in Linear Motion Kit (REV-15-1189) and the 1in Extrusion (REV-21-1000). The slide tab is offset allowing stages to fully nest when collapsed maximizing extension on multi-stage applications. Specifications Material: Acetal Copolymer Mounting Hole: Clearance and countersink for #10 Flat-head Hex Cap Screw (REV-29-1223) Documentation ION Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-21-1202…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1202/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/317/images/1085/REV-21-1202-1__81430.1513375618.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Hardware & Tools / Accessories', 'rev'),
  ('1in Inside Corner Bracket - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-1203-PK2', 'The 1in Inside Corner Bracket is designed to enable more construction strategies with the 1in Extrusion. Designed for #10 hardware, the mounting holes are on a 1in pitch that allows for the creation of complex joints by stacking with other 1in Brackets. The hole spacing also enables end-mounting to 1in Extrusion. Specifications Material: 6063 T5 Hardened Aluminum, Clear Anodized Mounting Hole Diameter: 0.22in Mounting Hole Pitch: 1in Length: 2.0in Width: 1.0in Height: 2.0in Weight:.09lbs…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/REV-21-1203/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/318/images/1131/1_Inside_Corner_Bracket__04514.1515795724.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('1in Bracket - 30deg V1', 'REV-21-1570', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(28) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1570', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Bracket - 45deg V1', 'REV-21-1571', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(29) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1571', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Bracket - 135deg V1', 'REV-21-1574', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(30) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1574', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Bracket - 150deg V1', 'REV-21-1575', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(31) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1575', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in End-mount Bearing Bracket V1', 'REV-21-1577', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(32) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1577', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Cross Bracket V1', 'REV-21-1582', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(33) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1582', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Joining Bracket V1', 'REV-21-1583', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(34) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-1583', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('NEO Brushless Motor V1.1', 'REV-21-1650', 'This product has been discontinued and replaced by the NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor. The NEO Brushless Motor is the first brushless motor designed to meet the unique demands of the FRC community. NEO offers an incredible power density due to its compact size and reduced weight. As it is designed to have similar performance characteristics and matching mounting features, NEO can be a drop-in replacement for CIM-style motors. This motor is perfect for your FRC Robot, Industrial platform or Warehouse…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1650/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/752/images/3031/REV-21-1650-NEO1.1-Hero-FINAL__64905.1692730050.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('NEO 550 Brushless Motor', 'REV-21-1651', 'The NEO 550 Brushless Motor is a member in the NEO family of brushless motors. Its output power and small size are specifically designed to make NEO 550 the perfect motor for intakes and other non-drivetrain robot mechanisms. Mounting holes and pilot match a standard 550 series motor, making it natively mount to many existing off-the-shelf gearboxes. NEO 550 has been optimized to work with the SPARK MAX Motor Controller to deliver best-in-class performance and feedback. Brushless motors like…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1651/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/508/images/2730/REV-21-1651-NEO550-iso-noflag-FINAL__53096.1650561900.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('NEO Vortex Brushless Motor', 'REV-21-1652', 'The NEO Vortex is a high-power, high-performance, and high-resolution sensored brushless motor that is compatible with the REV ION System. It features a dockable controller interface that can be mounted directly to the SPARK Flex Motor Controller or our NEO Vortex Solo Adapter allowing control from any brushless motor controller like the SPARK MAX Motor Controller. Its through-bore rotor is the heart of its unique interchangeable shaft system, facilitating easy integration with various robot…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1652/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/784/images/3224/REV-11-1652-NEOVortexBrushlessMotor-Hero-FINAL__08884.1704233487.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor', 'REV-21-1653', 'The NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor builds on the proven performance of the original NEO, delivering the same high-efficiency brushless power in a refined package designed for easier integration and mounting. With updates to its shaft, encoder connection, and overall profile, NEO 2.0 offers teams more flexibility and streamlined assembly while remaining fully compatible with existing REV ION ecosystem components. FRC Legal as of the 2026 season, NEO 2.0 continues to provide the power, efficiency, and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1653/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/914/images/3599/NEO2.0_TOP_FINAL__19534.1761063424.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('8mm to 1/2in Hex Adapter', 'REV-21-1879', 'With the 8mm to 1/2in Hex Adapter you can convert 8mm keyed shafts to drive 0.5in hex bore wheels, sprockets, gears, and more! Use these with any motors with a 8mm round keyed output shaft, like the NEO Brushless Motor (REV-21-1650). Specifications Material: Aluminum Thickness: 20mm (0.79in) Hole Diameter: 8mm (2mm Keyway) Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME PRODUCT QUANTITY 8mm to 1/2in Hex Adapter QTY 1 Retaining Clip QTY 4 2mm Keystock QTY 2 CAD & Drawings SKU-STP REV-21-1879 Onshape SKU-DR', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1879/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/574/images/1843/REV-21-1879-8mm-to-0.5-inch-Hex-FINAL__16959.1614451290.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('GT2 3mm NEO Pinion Pulley - 8mm Keyed - 16T', 'REV-21-1909', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-1909', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('1 Piece Shaft Collar - 1/2in Hex Bore - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-1911-PK4', 'The 1/2in Hex Bore Shaft Collars are used to prevent gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts from sliding out of place on a 1/2in hex shaft. All REV 1/2in Hex Bore Shaft Collars feature a boss, or bump out, to contact the inner race of bearings that facilitate motion. To install the plastic 1 Piece Shaft Collar (REV-21-1911), tighten the screw with a 5/32in hex key to secure the shaft collar onto the shaft. The aluminum 1 Piece Shaft Collar - Narrow (REV-21-2900) uses a 2.5mm hex key to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Shaft-Collars-0.5in-Hex-Bore/?sku=REV-21-1911-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/856/images/3591/Shaft_Collars_-_0.5in_Hex_Bore-Hero-FINAL__37835.1760543066.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('2 Piece Shaft Collar - 1/2in Hex Bore - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-1912-PK4', 'The 1/2in Hex Bore Shaft Collars are used to prevent gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts from sliding out of place on a 1/2in hex shaft. All REV 1/2in Hex Bore Shaft Collars feature a boss, or bump out, to contact the inner race of bearings that facilitate motion. To install the plastic 1 Piece Shaft Collar (REV-21-1911), tighten the screw with a 5/32in hex key to secure the shaft collar onto the shaft. The aluminum 1 Piece Shaft Collar - Narrow (REV-21-2900) uses a 2.5mm hex key to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Shaft-Collars-0.5in-Hex-Bore/?sku=REV-21-1912-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/856/images/3591/Shaft_Collars_-_0.5in_Hex_Bore-Hero-FINAL__37835.1760543066.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-1915-PK4', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-1915-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1/2in Rounded Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-1916-PK4', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-1916-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('18T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1920', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1920', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('20T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1921', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1921', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('22T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1922', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1922', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('24T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1923', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1923', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('26T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1924', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1924', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
